name measurebox
category Package
revision 75139
shortdesc Precise measurements of glyphs
longdesc MeasureBox is a (plain TeX) package for measuring material. It
longdesc is intended for precise measurements of glyphs so that they can
longdesc be manipulated by other macros and packages (e.g. the Stretchy
longdesc package). Its only dependency is the pdfToolbox package, which
longdesc is currently only supported by plain-pdfTeX.
